    "detailed_description": "A two-player co-op action shooting game created by students.<br>The setting is on a ship floating on the vast ocean. Let's work together to repel the large army of sharks that attack from 360 degrees!<br>Don't forget to reload and keep attacking, and when the gauge fills up, you'll have a chance to turn the tables with a giant firework!<br>Let's increase your score and confidence while watching each other's movements and helping each other!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiplayer</li></ul><br><strong>How to operate</strong><br>As shown in the basic buttons<br>Xbox controller standards<br><br>B:Decision<br>A:Cancel<br>Start: Pause<br>B: Gimmick action<br>X: Reload<br>R: Shooting<br>L:Lock on",
